{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27416","headline":"出塞即事二首 一 · 顾非熊","name":"出塞即事二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"塞山行尽到乌延，万顷沙堆见极边。\n河上月沉鸿鴈起，碛中风度犬羊膻。\n席箕草断城池外，护柳花开帐幕前。\n此处游人堪下泪，更闻终日望狼烟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾非熊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27416.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27416","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}